  "content": "\n\n# <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lalaalal/Naraka/26.2/common/src/main/resources/assets/naraka/textures/item/stigma_rod.png\" width=\"24\"> Naraka：赫伯林的崛起\n\n歡迎來到 Naraka！此模組新增了赫伯林首領、新礦脈，以及使用原版礦物打造的強力材料。擊敗首領以獲取獎勵，並使用這些新材料打造強力的武器吧！\n\n## 功能特色\n- 赫伯林：一位在赫伯林聖殿中等待的恐怖首領。\n- 鑽石傀儡：守護鑽石柱的強大實體。\n- Nectarium：一種獨特的可食用礦物，味道意外地美味！\n\n> ### ![聖殿指南針](https://github.com/lalaalal/Naraka/blob/26.2/common/src/main/resources/assets/naraka/textures/item/sanctuary_compass_00.png?raw=true) 前往赫伯林之路\n> 向流浪商人購買，或在村莊的製圖師箱子中搜尋**聖殿指南針**。\n\n<details>\n<summary>圖片</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/3724937cfb82b6ef598c69ff44102f81f8b180ba3db6a539ac36d19a1f936614/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f32496e53355377692f696d616765732f623433383032326262333332346537613638636137616433396230653863393565303038353630632e706e67\" width=\"256\">\n  <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/f4e19acaf8da64bdf69c5c1b00e9c03f0750775ede73e5d51829b954cfea5275/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f32496e53355377692f696d616765732f353931366234616535613462613161343438376530353438353766343430623739373862326533352e706e67\" width=\"256\">\n  <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9d1ef423d0a1d2f8681a4bed87fecaefbf616b1b1ee2c314225d5c8b650d5510/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f32496e53355377692f696d616765732f656131353662346164346665323562356236383534393439343033633065626233616361613439322e676966\" width=\"256\">\n</details>\n\n## 依賴項目\n- fabric-api（僅限 Fabric 版）\n \n## 致謝\n- Qiye_Duyu（繁體中文翻譯）\n- h2o/aoinnman（日文翻譯）\n- htohtosgoy（替代資源包）\n- Player_7（程式碼貢獻）\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ceRN9eZkXY0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>",
